PROCWHENCE(1)                  ZOAU Command Syntax                 PROCWHENCE(1)

NAME

	procwhence - Determine the source dataset of a proclib concatenation member.

SYNOPSIS

	procwhence [-dhv] <MEMBER-NAME>

	-d
		Print out debug messages.

	-h
		Display syntax help.

	-v
		Print out verbose command information.

DESCRIPTION

	procwhence searches the proclib concatenation for a particular dataset
	member. It prints the name of the dataset where the member is found.

EXAMPLES

	procwhence IEAVIPCS

EXIT VALUES

	0
		Success

	Other
		Error, see message for details

SEE ALSO

	parmwhence(1)
